  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Resilience Against Climate-Related Security Risks in Conflict-Prone Communities in Mindanao, Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the resiliency of conflict-prone communities in Bangsamoro Autonomous Region against climate-related security risks, IOM will ensure that regional and local government climate change adaptation and response mechanisms are conflict-sensitive and evidence-based; and that conflict-prone communities, including local enterprises and vulnerable individuals, are informed, have improved capacity and the resources to adapt to the impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
